title = "Four Wards"
text = "FOUR WARDS HOLD THE FIRST GATE, AND EACH WARD IS A LEVER. One stands in the open, guarded. One is up where the dead cannot climb, over the teeth. One is behind the fire, and the fire keeps time. The fourth is not on the road at all: listen for the stone that sounds hollow. All four. Any three is a locked door."

